### staleness is content-based for the API: touch alone is not stale, an edit is
ok   source freshness — image is newer than source
# harmless edit (trailing comment)
warn source freshness — running API differs from src/api in 1 file(s) (e.g. integrations/e2e_fixtures.py); rebuild with `make up` (or `docker compose up -d --build app`)
exit(--require-fresh)=1
# edit reverted
ok   source freshness — image is newer than source
